    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d91f4a7bd2480b3440a59e8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第二天，试着再次询问她\n今后是否有想参加的比赛——",
      "source_fingerprint": "51efc72be3d5e63adf8912f1fe508e4e89789fa6d60a91cf6653ca20f8dfdb53",
