    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02bc1d38b64ff56f9dbb002f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起……。那种事情，\n我不知道该怎么选择才好……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77a976c553af85c05507101d721f1b743befd9db6b07a5e2e634340b3a08039b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12e4d4b34db91bf9a711159c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不，如果有希望的话只是想了解一下",
      "source_fingerprint": "c269904b6d0c2519f7161f56bd05e62844048c94e258923b51e626e09db9de8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "choice_data_list",
