    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7584adf537c0c2bae73b00c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我知道……\n如果不更干脆利落地回答是不行的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e43f0922f0703a0bc4fe75fc339ff3dfa4562f97faedcb6d472e7c29f2e4d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9229419020a647c0410837b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然也有将出战特定比赛作为梦想的\n赛马娘，但并非如此的人也有很多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "432c6bbfc5ca2672a699e47c35f469da66cf64401ee3cb0de5cd8f418aeb8a8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6db3af4d9f2605753f9e1f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "倒不如说，根据担当赛马娘的适性，\n以及其他参赛者的倾向来选择比赛\n是训练员的重要工作。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b991731cef10d814997d9c4b9857d0638559c76c9b285f6f126126503b7862",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c12ca3c587400de83e970f58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果找到了想参加的比赛就马上告诉我",
      "source_fingerprint": "67a0bc7de66c6bdef972174f0a9b556495d6ba4d0be0aeb3cd92624c9552e061",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fbe7370ddb1032ca88a8c4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果找到了想参加的比赛要马上告诉我哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd6a5801ce03a0a06b3e0b99cd193436025ea821f182a05cb806f5d33bc7b6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
