    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3125944a63b5c07abe1d8257",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊……好的。我知道了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da13bec4cbd5f4779e79c3c97f6454c3ae002a9128a3196cb6f94d534fca5e76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9701add09315306234f2324",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也希望高尚骏逸总有一天\n能够自信地说出自己想参加的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a623ec02923b54d50c4fd56faee8f636eef5dcbb6f1ce323700c8cc047e05a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:064f6c22f2e32aae6f6e555a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（首先得决定方向性！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "29962367c8f35fbf27b60bcf1a65b242e6e54957d452b49f3899a3036ab6a17e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfad15809d53e66bc1db2523",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说那是她内心成长之后的事了。\n现在应该由我这边，\n来为她明示短期的目标吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28f0944b2327ad02a532ab4cb52226fbb380c3a96450f3672d5e76704ac2bff2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8110d5fcd3b18b65ae0016e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从赛场回来的路上——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5ad623133fd97ca4366e4ed3613bd44ddf7702de228ecc03ffadd788f17d8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d63639c7e845ae7e20ca1016",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了决定新马级的目标，\n我想先掌握她的擅长与不擅长之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bb39c6aea196aaf5037a96b495aaf06970995262e99c6da767d5143b27b11c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accb8a156db8723f0260412c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸特别在意的，\n是亲姐姐和妹妹与自己之间的差异。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5de422023f6d1fd68ba3056dc9ef859e5c8cca794ca207baeaf43593fc6dec",
